Model a Multiple Gap or a Multiple Pitch Conveyor
In this example we model a multiple gap and a multiple pitch Conveyor.
Model a Multiple Gap Conveyor
You can use the Conveyor 
  to model conveyors ensuring multiple gaps between the parts moving on it.
Multiple Gap sets the distance between the rear of the preceding MU and the front of the succeeding MU.
The distance can be an integer multiple of the defined MU Distance.
For the Source we selected the Uniform distribution with a Lower Bound of 0 and an Upper Bound of
0:04.
For the Conveyor we selected the settings below with the MU Distance Type > Multiple Gap and an MU
Distance of 1 meter.
Model a Multiple Gap or a Multiple Pitch Conveyor
10-764 Plant Simulation Help
Unpublished work. © 2026 Siemens

When we run the simulation, we see that the Conveyor does not stop to wait for new MUs after the gap
has passed, but that the next MU can only enter the Conveyor if an integer multiple of the gap can be
preserved.
Open the EventDebugger, step through the simulation event by event, and watch the event types
CheckMUDistance, CreateMU, and Out.
Model a Multiple Gap or a Multiple Pitch Conveyor
Plant Simulation Help 10-765
Unpublished work. © 2026 Siemens

Model a Multiple Pitch Conveyor
To model a Multiple Pitch Conveyor, we duplicated our Multiple Gap Conveyor model and changed the
setting MU Distance Type to Multiple Pitch.
Multiple Pitch sets the distance between the front of the preceding MU and the front of the succeeding
MU. The distance can be an integer multiple of the defined MU Distance. We did not change any other
settings.
When we run the simulation, we see that the Conveyor does not stop to wait for new MUs after the pitch
has passed, but that the next MU can only enter the Conveyor if an integer multiple of the pitch can be
preserved. For this setting the Conveyor behaves like a chain conveyor.
Open the EventDebugger, step through the simulation event by event, and watch the event types
CheckMUDistance, CreateMU, and Out.
Model a Multiple Gap or a Multiple Pitch Conveyor
10-766 Plant Simulation Help
Unpublished work. © 2026 Siemens

