Program the Collision Control
To program the Collision Control named hitchMethod, which we inserted above, double-click the Method
object. We want this control to hitch the colliding trailer to the one in front of it. To do so, we have to
establish the trailer moving in front of the active trailer.
Finally, we are going to hitch the rear Transporter to the one moving in front of it to create the tugger
train.
