Plant Simulation Help 10-789
Unpublished work. © 2026 Siemens

We connect the SourceTransporters with the object MyTrack5 with a Connector.
• For the SourceParts we only selected our part named MyPart as the MU. Apart from that we use the
default settings.
As we want to move the parts with a control to the LoadingStation, we do not need a Connector
between the two stations.
• For our Transporter named MyTransporter we activate automatic routing on the tab Routing.
