one after the other from M1 to M4. To better follow the route, we entered the Real-time factor 3 in the
EventController.
The AGV does not drive across the inserted Markers but turns in front of the inserted Markers according
to the angle that Plant Simulation computed toward the next Marker. For our model it looks like this:
