Back to Load Parts Onto an AGV and Rotate Them
Fine-position an AGV
If the AGV is driving freely within the area of your model, you will sometimes have to fine-position it.
You can achieve this with the methods rotate and drive of the Transporter.
In our example the AGV drives from the AGVPool via the Marker named M1 to the Marker named M2.
There it rotates by 90° to the left and drives 2 meters upward. Afterward it moves sideways in a 90° angle
1.6 meters to the left, and loads the part from the Station. Then it moves sideways in a 90° angle 1.6
meters to the right and drives backward to the Marker M2.
On the Marker M2 the AGV rotates 90° to the right and drives via the Marker named M3 to the Marker
named M4. There it unloads the part onto the Station1 and drives back to the AGVPool via the Markers M2
and M1.
The finished simulation model looks like this:
Fine-position an AGV
Plant Simulation Help 10-831
Unpublished work. © 2026 Siemens

We use the material flow objects and the resource objects with their default settings. We fine-position the
AGV in our init method by using the methods setRoute, rotate, and drive of the Transporter.
The source code of our init method looks like this. The comments describe what the instructions
accomplish.
var AGV := AGVPool.Cont
AGV.setRoute([M1, M2])             // AGV drives to the marker M2
stopuntil AGV.DestinationWasReached
AGV.rotate(-90)                    // AGV rotates 90° to the left
stopuntil AGV.DestinationWasReached
AGV.drive(2)                       // AGV drives 2m upward
stopuntil AGV.DestinationWasReached
AGV.drive(1.6, -90)                   // AGV moves sideways in a 
stopuntil AGV.DestinationWasReached   // 90° angle 1.6 m to the left
var MU := Station.Cont
waituntil MU.Finished                 // MU waits until it's processed
wait 2                                // MU waits 2 seconds
MU.move(AGV)                          // MU moves to the AGV
wait 2                                // AGV waits 2 seconds
AGV.drive(1.6, 90)                    // AGV moves sideways in a 
Fine-position an AGV
