settings.
• For the TransferStation we selected these settings:
• For the PickAndPlace robot, which unloads the parts from the Transporter and places them on the
Conveyor, we use a Loading Time and an Unloading Time of 2 minutes each and these settings on the
tab Exit.
• For the Conveyor we created this sensor at which the PickAndPlace robot places the parts.
