We entered our startCharging control as the Entrance Control into the ChargingStation of the
Transporter.
Additional Settings
Plant Simulation Help 10-853
Unpublished work. © 2026 Siemens

For the ParkingPosition to which the Transporter with fully charged battery drives we use the standard
